  <item>
    <title>NO2、韩国留学生回国在成都创业做咖啡馆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6200e51d4675a08411f51a3a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6200e51d4675a08411f51a3a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Feb 2022 09:23:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>播客背景：</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期邀请成都“幕咖啡”创始人刘畅一起聊聊在成都创业，做咖啡馆的经历。目前“幕咖啡”经营2年，在2021年也经历第2家店开店的经历，深入聊聊咖啡馆经营的痛点，到底什么的情况下可以去创业做咖啡馆。</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期嘉宾：刘畅</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>韩国留学生</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>成都“幕咖啡”创始人</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期主持人：小飞</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>成都运营职场人，一位新的播客主持人。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>喜欢播客轻松愉快的方式</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间线</span></strong><span>：</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">2:27</a> 留学生回国创业资源会弱于国内大学生的创业。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">3:59</a> 有哪些比较有个性化的咖啡馆品牌。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 咖啡馆做外卖跟瑞幸、星巴克比不好做。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 咖啡馆有效的运营手法，大众点评、小红书。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 咖啡馆创业经历首先是选址、然后开了大众点评。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 咖啡馆（单店）私域会员其实非常难做。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 两年经营时间，经营成本是否能持平？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 咖啡馆需要哪些硬成本支出？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 经营的过程有没有哪些坑，导致了亏损。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 新的一年，我虽然做了两年咖啡，但是我不想做咖啡了。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 经营咖啡馆与职场上班，哪个收益比较大？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 回韩国创业做民宿，会比现在好很多。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 现在创业选择咖啡馆和奶茶店是否可以？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 喝手冲咖啡基本是喜爱咖啡的人群，会比较精准。</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 哪些人会比较适合开咖啡馆？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 运营咖啡馆最大的困难是什么？感触最深的是什么？</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>皮蛋-Long Way Home</span></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvxkhjwrjX2rvZzsV46uZ1Uh2DXC.m4a" length="98873732" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtdHdHcFRCS2FUTThRVU9ZRE1CYzBHaWNtZ3QucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
