  <item>
    <title>NO1、成都与北京的运营环境差距在哪里？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61e7807521c23a45ed5d607d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61e7807521c23a45ed5d607d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jan 2022 03:07:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在成都的运营人会说成都运营环境不好，今天就邀请从成都到北京工作的运营人，体验过两个城市的运营生活，看看成都与北京的运营环境有哪些差距，运营人要不要选择去北京或上、广、深。</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>朱师佳</span></strong></p><p><span>6年招聘行业运营人</span></p><p><strong><span>【主持人】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>小飞</span></strong></p><p><span>成都运营职场人</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 为什么离开成都去北京？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">2:37</a> 准备去北京前，用了一年做规划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">4:59</a> 初次到北京感觉怎么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">8:36</a> 薪酬与消费对比，其实北京城市消费不低</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 北京最大的挑战是高手太多了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 从招聘角度看成都与北京的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> 怎么去定义互联网平台</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> 运营岗位成都与北京的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> 求职招聘平台通过大数据算法匹配，后期会更加精准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> 职场中换工作的周期多久会比较合适</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 职场生涯中那个节点适合是一线城市发展</span></p><p><span>【后期制作】</span></p><p><span>小飞</span></p><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><p><span>Dazy Chain-Where I Wanna Be</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmClJsnYIqiLk1NIjP1AWQYWrB5W.m4a" length="61222281" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:46</itunes:duration>
